 "general": {
  "objective": [
   "To process the DTP records submitted on DTP Creation: create one Daily order per record for the LP Admin (Planning Order / DTP Creation Release).",
   "In case of an error the record is set to FAILED with the reason; the planner can retry it. Successful records are never processed twice."
  ],
