 "func_desc": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "4. DESCRIPTION",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Background service for the records submitted on DTP Creation. Each record is handled in its own transaction so one failure never blocks the others.",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": false
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "4.1 Status flow of a record",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "columns": [
    {
     "title": "From",
     "width": 10
    },
    {
     "title": "To",
     "width": 10
    },
    {
     "title": "By",
     "width": 22
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "READY",
     "SUBMITTED",
     "Screen [Confirm Submit]"
    ],
    [
     "SUBMITTED",
     "QUEUED",
     "Batch step 2"
    ],
    [
     "QUEUED",
     "PROCESSING",
     "Batch step 3"
    ],
    [
     "PROCESSING",
     "PROCESSED",
     "Batch step 6"
    ],
    [
     "PROCESSING",
     "FAILED",
     "Batch step 7"
    ],
    [
     "FAILED",
     "QUEUED",
     "Screen [Retry]"
    ]
   ],
   "level": 1,
   "row_lines": "all"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "4.2 Daily order",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "items": [
    "One order per DTP record; type UNIVERSAL; status Planning Order; first cycle DTP Creation Release (same as orders created by DTP Check & Submit).",
    "LP name and location names come from the masters / data mapping; Planned Cycle = 2 when ROUND_USE = 'Y', else 1 (TBD OP-05).",
    "The LP Admin sees the order in Daily Monitoring (Truck Assignment menu TBD); Reject by LP returns it to the planner (calendar: Rejected by LP)."
   ],
   "marker": "1.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "column_break"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "4.3 No double processing",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "items": [
    "Only SUBMITTED / QUEUED records are selected; PROCESSED is final.",
    "Row lock (skip locked) prevents two runs from taking the same record.",
    "ORDER_NO is written in the same transaction as the order; a rollback leaves the record without order (FAILED)."
   ],
   "marker": "1.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "4.4 Errors",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "items": [
    "Master changed since submit (no. 5): FAILED; correct master, then Retry.",
    "Order creation error / timeout (no. 6): FAILED, retryable.",
    "Attempts >= max (no. 7): stays FAILED, notification TBD (OP-08)."
   ],
   "marker": "1.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true,
   "text": "4.x Payment Type (rev 0.2)"
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "The Daily order keeps the Payment Type of its DTP record. Submit already guarantees a valid Payment Type for companies with Master KPI (DTP Creation KM-15); the queue does not change it."
  }
 ],
